OL,3,GNEWSAOverhaul for Belfast cranes ahead
OL,4,Aof major contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Harland and Wolff shipyard is to
OL,7,Fspend #3m refurbishing its famous
OL,8,Fyellow cranes, Samson and Goliath.
OL,10,FIt is part of an investment of almost
OL,11,F#100m as the Belfast yard's Spanish
OL,12,Fowners prepare it for a major defence
OL,13,Fcontract.
OL,15,FThe yard is the integration and final
OL,16,Fassembly site for three Royal Navy
OL,17,Fsupport ships in what is known as the
OL,18,FFleet Solid Support (FSS) programme.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
